===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|dunc}}, from {{inh|fr|VL.|dunc}}, from a crossing of {{der|fr|la|tunc}} with {{m|la|dum}}. Compare {{cog|it|dunque}} {{cog|oc|donc}} and {{cog|ca|doncs}}.

===Pronunciation===
